<title>JAPAN: MOF says Japan to stick to easy credit policy.</title>
<headline>MOF says Japan to stick to easy credit policy.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finance Minister Hiroshi Mitsuzuka said on Wednesday that Japan would maintain its current easy credit policy, as the Bank of Japan had made clear.</p>
<p>&quot;Our policy is to maintain our current interest rate policy for a while without raising interest rates, as the Bank of Japan has made clear,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>Mitsuzuka was speaking to a parliamentary committee.</p>
